{"v":4,"catch":"Cozmo軍團結盟！\n打倒大BOSS“DON COSMO”！","desc":"“COSMO GANG THE VIDEO”是 NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於 1992 年發行的一款動作遊戲。\n操作Cosmopolis“鬥士”HYPER BEAT，擊退盜賊“COSMO GANGS”。\n通過擊敗 GANG（舞台）中的所有 Cozmo Gang 來清除舞台。\n如果擊中敵人的攻擊，就會失去一個“HYPER BEAT”，如果失去一切，遊戲就會結束。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-04-20","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3e308a1633873fbca26863aa1825c322d04b25541dfbb1dc6b57fb53d13f1e4a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0c17d898b950560e78645c4321f8de0bf990c16cc85b6bad490a88280a6a8b88.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c52bdc6eb8dc77518c9544b721bfaef65e946a0087cd02dd97ac5971263e2781.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d0ff13c021a948820cbba3109f9af0092bbc5841d2a830ae40011012b03d4b3c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f11b24f9fed3385206d99e0b619370e40ad3d13c6b4fe065b002de84dabe295b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2e8c75c5799e0a518d311aeaf715f7b2f3061a38d03a0d0376902e1ceea6e7f6.jpg"],"titleId":"0100fa401a6b4000","dlc":[]}